  "content": "\n\n<h1><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xHyroM/seasonal-letsdo/ver/1.20.1/.github/logo.png\" alt=\"let&#x27;s do 寧靜季節縮圖\"></h1>\n<p><strong>Seasonal Let's Do</strong> 是一款模組，旨在讓 <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's Do 系列模組</a> 與受歡迎的季節系統（如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fserene-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serene Seasons</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Seasons</a> 及 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fforge-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Seasons</a>）之間實現無縫相容。</p>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<p>感謝為 Serene Seasons 相容性提供資料包的原作者 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fNobodyH3re\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NobodyH3re</a>。</p>\n<p>本模組採用 <a href=\"https://github.com/xhyrom/seasonal-letsdo/blob/ver/1.21/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache-2.0 授權條款</a> 發布。</p>",
